Fix the config schema of the display_builder views display extender.

Project: https://www.drupal.org/project/display_builder
Version: 1.0.0-beta4
Upstream issue: https://www.drupal.org/project/display_builder/issues/3534215
(fixed on 1.0.x; released in 1.0.0, whose schema declares
`sources: {type: sequence, sequence: {type: ignore}}`). Drop this patch
when the project upgrades from 1.0.0-beta4.

THE DEFECT IS TWO DEFECTS, both in the `sources` element of
`views.display_extender.display_builder`.

1. `sources` has a `sequence:` child but no `type: sequence`, so the
   element falls back to `Undefined` and every save of a view carrying
   the extender reports
   `…display_extenders.display_builder.sources missing schema`.

2. With that alone fixed, the next error is
   `…sources.0.source_id missing schema` plus `…sources.0.source` and
   `…sources.0.node_id`. A sequence ITEM is the `{source_id, source,
   node_id}` triple a display-builder node is, while the
   `ui_patterns_source.*` types describe only the `source` half of it —
   `ui_patterns_source.component`, for instance, is a mapping with the
   single key `component`. Measured, not assumed: applying only the
   added line and installing `views.view.tickets` under strict config
   schema still fails, with those three errors per display.

THE SHAPE THIS PATCH SUPPLIES IS THE PROJECT'S OWN. The sibling module
`display_builder_page_layout` stores the SAME tree and declares it
`sources: {type: sequence, sequence: {type: ignore}}`. This patch makes
the views extender agree with it, so the two halves of one contrib
project stop disagreeing about the shape of one data structure.
`ignore` is the honest type: a node's validity is decided by the source
PLUGIN it names, which typed config cannot reach from a schema file.

WHY IT MATTERS. `ConfigSchemaChecker` is a test-only event listener, so
on a running site the defect is completely silent. But
`KernelTestBase::$strictConfigSchema` is TRUE by default, so with the
defect in place no test can install a view carrying the extender at
all: the install throws `SchemaIncompleteException` before a single
assertion runs.

--- a/modules/display_builder_views/config/schema/display_builder_views.schema.yml
+++ b/modules/display_builder_views/config/schema/display_builder_views.schema.yml
@@ -9,7 +9,8 @@
           prefix: 'display_builder.profile.'
     sources:
       label: 'UI Patterns sources'
+      type: sequence
       sequence:
-        type: ui_patterns_source.[source_id]
+        type: ignore
   constraints:
     FullyValidatable: ~
